# Microsoft: Back to Top floats in the corner; ArrowDown from a panel's button went to it instead of the next panel's link.
# The promo cards change order and name from one visit to the next, so this checks where the ring did not go.
https://www.microsoft.com/en-us
wait:3000
key:ArrowDown
key:ArrowRight*3
key:ArrowDown
key:ArrowDown*2
wait:800
key:ArrowDown
expect-not:Back to Top
